<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Normain — System Data Flow (SOC 2 2026)</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1f2733; --muted:#5b6675; --line:#d9dee6; --bg:#f6f8fb; --card:#fff;
    --normain:#2563eb; --normain-bg:#eff4ff;
    --azure:#0e7490; --azure-bg:#e6f6fa;
    --aws:#d97706; --aws-bg:#fdf3e3;
    --eea:#15803d; --eea-bg:#f0faf2;
    --neutral:#64748b; --neutral-bg:#f1f4f8;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
    font:15px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;}
  .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 48px;}
  h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px;}
  .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0 0 14px;}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .chip{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);}
  .chip.draft{background:#fff7ed;border-color:#fed7aa;color:#b45309;}
  /* region containers */
  .region{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:14px 14px 16px;margin:0 0 14px;position:relative;}
  .region.eea{border:1.5px dashed var(--eea);background:var(--eea-bg);}
  .region.normain{border:1.5px solid var(--normain);background:var(--normain-bg);}
  .label{display:inline-block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:3px 9px;border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .label.eea{background:var(--eea);color:#fff;}
  .label.normain{background:var(--normain);color:#fff;}
  .label.neutral{background:var(--neutral);color:#fff;}
  .label.azure{background:var(--azure);color:#fff;}
  .label.aws{background:var(--aws);color:#fff;}
  .grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;}
  .col{flex:1 1 0;min-width:200px;}
  .twocol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}
  .twocol > .region{flex:1 1 320px;margin:0;}
  /* cards */
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-width:150px;flex:1 1 150px;}
  .card b{display:block;font-size:13.5px;}
  .card span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:1px;}
  .sectionhead{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:2px 0 8px;}
  /* flow arrow */
  .arrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin:2px 0 12px;}
  .arrow .ln{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line);}
  .arrow b{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);}
  /* flows + legend */
  .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:18px;}
  .panel h2{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;}
  ol.flows{margin:0;padding-left:20px;}
  ol.flows li{margin:5px 0;font-size:13.5px;}
  .legend{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:8px 18px;margin-top:6px;}
  .legend div{font-size:12.8px;color:var(--muted);}
  .legend b{color:var(--ink);}
  .sw{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-1px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Normain — System Data Flow</h1>
  <p class="sub">SOC 2 2026 system description · DC 3.1. Production data path for the in-scope system; hosting modes in scope: SaaS open-platform &amp; Logical separation.</p>
  <div class="chips">
    <span class="chip">Security category only</span>
    <span class="chip">Examination period 4 May – 4 Aug 2026</span>
    <span class="chip draft">DRAFT — engineering to validate (arch. as of 2026-06)</span>
  </div>

  <!-- EXTERNAL -->
  <div class="region">
    <span class="label neutral">External — customer side</span>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><b>Customer end-users</b><span>Browser → app.normain.com / per-tenant subdomain</span></div>
      <div class="card"><b>Content sources (read-only)</b><span>SharePoint · Google Drive · Box (OAuth / Graph)</span></div>
      <div class="card"><b>Direct input</b><span>UI upload · customer-supplied URLs</span></div>
      <div class="card"><b>Identity providers (MFA at IdP)</b><span>Entra ID (per tenant) · Google OAuth · email+password (platform tenant only)</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow"><span class="ln"></span><span>↓&nbsp; <b>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+</b> · auth via IdP · content ingest</span><span class="ln"></span></div>

  <!-- EEA boundary -->
  <div class="region eea">
    <span class="label eea">EEA / EU data residency</span>

    <!-- edge -->
    <div class="sectionhead">Edge</div>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
      <div class="card"><b>Cloudflare</b><span>Authoritative DNS (normain.com)</span></div>
      <div class="card"><b>Istio ingress gateway</b><span>TLS 1.2+ termination · per-tenant certs</span></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Normain boundary -->
    <div class="region normain">
      <span class="label normain">Normain system boundary — Azure AKS (aks-normain-prod-01)</span>
      <div class="sectionhead">Application tier (per tenant)</div>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
        <div class="card"><b>Web UI</b></div>
        <div class="card"><b>API</b></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Tenant API</b><span>Marketplace subscription &amp; provisioning</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Worker</b><span>ingest · processing · AI calls</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Redis</b><span>in-cluster cache/queue</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sectionhead">Data stores (per tenant · AES-256 at rest)</div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><b>PostgreSQL</b><span>Flexible Server v16 · network-private</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Blob Storage</b><span>per-tenant containers</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Azure Files (NFS)</b><span>per-tenant share</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Key Vault</b><span>secrets (via CSI)</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>Log Analytics + immutable storage</b><span>audit logs · 365 days</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arrow"><span class="ln"></span><span>AI inference · OCR · transcription · email · telemetry &nbsp;→</span><span class="ln"></span></div>

    <!-- subservices -->
    <div class="twocol">
      <div class="region">
        <span class="label azure">Carved-out subservice — Microsoft Azure</span>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card"><b>Azure OpenAI</b><span>OpenAI models</span></div>
          <div class="card"><b>Document Intelligence</b><span>OCR / layout</span></div>
          <div class="card"><b>Speech</b><span>transcription</span></div>
          <div class="card"><b>Communication Services</b><span>transactional email</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="region">
        <span class="label aws">Carved-out subservice — AWS (EU)</span>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card"><b>Anthropic models</b><span>AI inference · SaaS open-platform mode</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sectionhead" style="margin-top:14px;">Observability (EU)</div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><b>BetterStack</b><span>logs &amp; traces via OpenTelemetry</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- key flows -->
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Key data flows</h2>
    <ol class="flows">
      <li><b>Access:</b> user → Cloudflare DNS → Istio gateway (HTTPS, TLS 1.2+) → Web UI / API.</li>
      <li><b>Auth:</b> user ↔ identity provider (Entra ID / Google / email+password); MFA enforced at the IdP.</li>
      <li><b>Ingest:</b> Worker/API pull customer content from SharePoint / Drive / Box (read-only), direct upload, and URLs.</li>
      <li><b>Process &amp; store:</b> Worker ↔ PostgreSQL; writes to Blob &amp; Azure Files; secrets pulled from Key Vault.</li>
      <li><b>AI inference:</b> Worker → Azure OpenAI / Document Intelligence / Speech, and → AWS Anthropic (SaaS open-platform).</li>
      <li><b>Output:</b> results returned to the user; transactional email via Azure Communication Services.</li>
      <li><b>Telemetry:</b> app logs/traces → BetterStack (EU); audit logs → Log Analytics + immutable storage (365 days).</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <!-- legend -->
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Legend &amp; notes</h2>
    <div class="legend">
      <div><span class="sw" style="background:var(--normain)"></span><b>Normain system boundary</b> — operated by Normain.</div>
      <div><span class="sw" style="background:var(--azure)"></span><b>Azure</b> &amp; <span class="sw" style="background:var(--aws)"></span><b>AWS</b> — carved-out subservice organisations.</div>
      <div><span class="sw" style="background:var(--eea);"></span><b>EEA boundary</b> — all processing &amp; storage stay in the EU.</div>
      <div><b>In transit:</b> TLS 1.2+ on external legs; internal VNet/pod traffic network-isolated (not mTLS).</div>
      <div><b>At rest:</b> AES-256 (Microsoft-managed keys); selected fields app-layer encrypted.</div>
      <div><b>Isolation:</b> per-tenant namespace, database, storage container, NFS share.</div>
      <div><b>Subprocessor inventory of record:</b> DPA Appendix B + Vendor Master Sheet.</div>
      <div><b>Excluded:</b> operational / non-data-path vendors (billing, marketing, IDE, etc.).</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
